{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36563578/0fe43d1a93d8e3932f23a91074b1541d184536c2.jpg

After the first few days of Cumming Hotel's launching, I've been receiving amazing feedback about the game. Based on many suggestions you guys sent me, I've made a few improvements to give you all a better experience of this unusual genre in the East. Some people may have noticed the game received a few updates during these days like version 1.00a, 1.00b, etc. To summarize them, I’ve made a list of all the news. Check them out!

 Garlic respawns in the Horny Tower;
 Newspapers with different news for each day;
 Young Sorcerer's Quest (now you can save her dog in the Horny Tower and learn a special skill - only after Kyle reaches level 10);
 Dushi's Quest (now you can sell 10 tomatoes to earn extra money);
 People recognizing Kyle after he starts to perform at the bar and the Orcs starting to appear in Magnolia Village;
 New mini-events like a Lost Bather and an Undecided Adventurer;
 Kyle's 'sprite' removed during the Horny Tower hunt;
 Bug fixed on Buzba's Quest;
 Holy Cut damage reduced, now it gives only extra damage - opposite to the 'instakill' potential from the first game version;
 Misspellings fixed;

And the most important things:

 9 different small dialogs for Bruce and Kyle after their workday (5 for Bruce and 4 for Kyle) - now you can discover a little bit more about their feelings/past life;
 Insertion of a Game Manual - now you can understand some aspects of how the game works such as what Couple's Desire and Trust means in a practical way and how they can impact to the gameplay. If you have already started the game, you can get a Manual by interacting with the Red Crystal close to Lady Ursula’s shop;
 ‘Work Board’ - now you can access services requirements and workdays available for all 'potential clients' in the game through a board close to the main desk of the hotel.

If you find any bugs, please, use the game’s forum or join Male Discord to report them.

Thank you all for supporting me!

Stay tuned.

